{
  "title": "Youthful Tender Brazilian Chicken Skewers",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Brazilian dish featuring sherry and long-fermentation-dough, served on a lazy-susan-spinner, this recipe is floral, tender, and gluten-free-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Brazilian",
  "diet": [
